1
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:24,800
Seventh Brother

2
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:27,280
Are you still happy?

3
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:29,800
Imperial Brother

4
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,200
You're not my husband

5
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:38,800
He went through great hardships to get medicine for you

6
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:40,960
What's wrong with repaying him?

7
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:43,360
It's not like this

8
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:44,680
It's not like this

9
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,000
This is

10
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,760
The Dragon Jade Treasure is with you

11
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,560
Heaven is truly helping me

12
00:02:00,960 --> 00:02:02,320
Heaven helps me

13
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,560
Don't let your imagination run wild

14
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:23,520
As long as that thing doesn't happen

15
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:24,760
Nothing will go wrong

16
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:28,720
Back then, you were just like me

17
00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:30,680
A pitiful person at others' mercy

18
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:33,400
You've really changed a lot

19
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,560
Highly skilled in martial arts

20
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:38,960
You don't seem as humble as before around Zhu Huaichen

21
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:41,160
And you've gained trusted guards

22
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:45,400
Moreover, you've saved me repeatedly

23
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:49,880
Could it be you've been reborn like me?

24
00:02:49,880 --> 00:02:50,440
Zhi An

25
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:03,240
Don't be afraid, Zhi An

26
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:07,280
I'm here

27
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,920
I'll always be here

28
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:30,400
Steward Duan, what do you mean by this?

29
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:33,120
We have distinguished guests in the mansion today

30
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:35,480
The imperial consort is skilled in sword dancing

31
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:39,160
This is the most expensive ceremonial robe from Jinbao Zhai this season

32
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:41,280
If the imperial consort wears it to dance

33
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:43,640
She will surely shine brilliantly

34
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:46,480
Steward Duan wants our imperial consort to dance for the guests' entertainment

35
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:47,520
This is unacceptable

36
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:49,720
I'll go

37
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:53,400
The imperial consort is indeed more sensible

38
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:04,120
I remember she clearly made me wear shabby clothes

39
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,280
to attend the banquet

40
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:06,680
and made a complete fool of myself

41
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:09,560
Why would she prepare fine clothes for me now?

42
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:14,880
But coincidentally, that envoy from Western Region is quite lecherous

43
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:18,400
Zhu Huaichen arranged many beautiful maids to serve him

44
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:20,560
If I can attract his attention

45
00:04:20,880 --> 00:04:22,320
Zhu Huaichen will surely offer me to the Western Envoy to secure the alliance

46
00:04:22,320 --> 00:04:24,240
That will be our chance to strike him down

47
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:27,280
Huamei, help me get dressed

48
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:30,120
As you wish

49
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:31,440
Hah, Li Zhi'an

50
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:24,520
How I wish to chain you up

51
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:27,520
Forcing you to look at me day and night

52
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:30,360
And hate me

53
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,680
Huamei, assist me with my makeup

54
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:33,680
Yet you have no choice but to rely on me

55
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:19,320
Imperial Brother

56
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:22,160
Third Sister-in-law dancing alone seems rather dull

57
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:24,320
This younger brother volunteers to accompany with sword dance

58
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:43,680
I never knew Seventh Brother could perform sword dances

59
00:06:44,440 --> 00:06:47,600
This is also my first time seeing Third Sister-in-law's graceful movements

60
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:49,800
Hence I was inspired to partner with her

61
00:06:51,080 --> 00:06:52,080
Moved by genuine feeling

62
00:06:52,080 --> 00:06:53,040
If I've caused any offense

63
00:06:53,760 --> 00:06:55,040
I beg Third Sister-in-law's forgiveness

64
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:56,800
How could that be?
